  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu akwa mutaŋa waIsarela, tiyenu izu danahoshiyi Yehova nanenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Bayi mudizakwila mwelaŋa nyuzaku, bayi mwakamakijilu yamwiwuluku; nyuza chayi monaŋawu ayakamaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa uyanyuza yawantu yakuhemesha. Muloŋa iwu hakutema mutondu twisaŋa, hiwukalawenu wakumakasa amukwawukalawenu wakwila lizembi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awukudekaŋa siliva nawuru, awukoleshaŋa nambwambu lamala kulonda wubuli kuswila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yidi neyi mukoma wakusoŋa, hiyalaŋaku. Chiŋa ayisenda yakusenda, muloŋa hiyatweshaŋa kwendaku. Bayi muyitiyaloŋa womaku, muloŋa hiyatwesha kwila yatamaku, hiyikweti; wila yayiwahuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yehova, hikwekala wudi neyi eyuku. Eyi wumuneni, ijina deyi yini naŋovu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Mwanta wanyuza, wukubula kukutiya eyi woma i? Muloŋa chakutelela, nanochu chikuneli kudi akwamaana ejima nyuza, nimuwanta wawu wejima, hikwekala wudi neyi eyuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena ivu adi neyi anyama hohu, asupa; yalejaŋayi nkishi yakuhemesha, jtondu hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudi siliva yanafumishuwu kuTarashi shiyana chiluwu ubasa, niwuru wakuUfwazi himudimu wamukwawukala wenu wakumaamuchi wawuru; nimahinawu akuyivwikaŋa awuzeeli nawusombu; ahiwukalawenu wawakwama ana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova kwindihi Nzambi walala; zambi wahandaŋa, himwanta wahaya nyaka; iseki dazaalaŋa nandombu yindi, nyuza hiyinatweshi kwimana kukuzuwa kwinduku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu chimwakayila, kayilenu nenu, Akishi abulili kuleŋa mawulu aseki, diwu akanoŋela hamaseki nimwishina damawulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena neli maseki naŋovu jindi, nakoleshi mpata yamunu mwishina ana indi, natanjiki mawulu nakashinshi kindi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chakuhoshayi izu dindi nawulu mwikala niipumba dameji, wakakumwishaŋa chishishi kunsari, wakeneshaŋa kulonda kunoki nvula, wedishaŋa mpepela mwaswekyuma yindi yalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu ejima anabalumuki neyi anyama, hiyeluka naku; achi awuru ejima anayitiyishi nsonyi kudi akishi awu akusoŋa; muloŋa akishi awu akusuŋununa hiyuma yakutwamba, himwekala muuya ku Iyuma yakuhemesha kwayu, himudimu wakudidimba nachu; mumpinjiiyi hempulawu akakisika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iseka daYakoba hididi neyi yumiyuku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mukwakutuŋa yuma yejima; aIsarela diwu muchidi wawuswana windi; dindi diyi Yehova wamazaza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi washakama mumukala wanakuchikuwu, nonaku mafunda eyi umi mwituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova nahoshi nindi, Tiyenu, antu ashana mwituŋa nukuyisahulamu mumpinji yinu, nukuyikabisha kulonda tiyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyavami nshona, anankatishi! chitu chami chinakati. Ilaŋa ami nelili nami, Chalala hiyikatu yami, nikumini dakuyikata hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itei dami adibuwa dehi, nyonji yami yejima yaketoka dehi; anyanami ananfumi dehi, hiyekala nawa kwokuku; hikudi wakunlemena cheŋi itenti dami hela wakunkudikila mahinamuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atubiŋa anabalumuki dehi neyi anyama, hiyanehuli kudi Yehovaku; dichi mudimu wawu kuya kumbidi nehi, nyikanka yawu yanyikoku yejima yinamwaŋali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, hikukwinza izu danáwunáwu, niipumba dadeni hidikufuma kwituŋa dakukabeta kakuchimunswa, dakubalumuna nyikala yamuYuda yiikali mahembi akushakama anyumbu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yehova, neluki nami njila yamuntu hiyekala mudi yomwenuku, mudi muntu wendaŋa himwekala yakuyula nyendu yinduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yehova, mbabeshi, chiŋa dinu mwawuŋaji; bayi nakunzuwilaku, wakenza kambalumuna tuhu kwikala neyi hinidi nikwokuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichilaku kulendumuka kweyi hadi nyuza yabula kukwiluka, nihadi yisaka yawantu abulaŋa kutambika ijina deyi; muloŋa wena diwu anamudyi Yakoba, eŋa, anamu dehi, anamundyi dehi, anamunoŋeshi dehi, mwáshakaminiyi abalumunamu dehi kwamahembi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
